  "description": "APAWOH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 N12 O16 Sm4,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Sm01 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm02 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.652-3.930 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.10-112.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm4(L1)6(acac)4(μ3-OH)2]·CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
